---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
import {pixelSkills,skillDownload} from '../../../public/skill-catalog.js';
const skills=(await getCollection('skills')).filter(item=>item.data.published).sort((a,b)=>pixelSkills.findIndex(s=>s.id===a.id)-pixelSkills.findIndex(s=>s.id===b.id));
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Skill 盒 · HiFage</title><link rel="stylesheet" href={`${base}skills.css`}/></head><body><main><a href={base}>← 回到发哥的桌面</a><p class="eyebrow">SKILL BOX</p><h1>把好用的方法，装进 Skill 盒。</h1>{skills.length ? <ul class="skill-cards">{skills.map(skill=><li><a href={`${base}skills/${skill.id}/`}>{skill.data.title}</a><p>{skill.data.description}</p>{skill.data.downloadId && <a class="skill-download" href={skillDownload(skill.data.downloadId)} download={`${skill.data.downloadId}.zip`}>下载 ZIP ↓</a>}<a class="skill-guide" href={`${base}skills/${skill.id}/`}>安装与用法 →</a></li>)}</ul> : <section><h2>第一批资源正在整理</h2><p>目前还没有公开的 Skill 或下载文件。准备好后，会在这里写清用途、适用工具与使用说明。</p><p>微信搜索「发哥聊一聊AI」，继续看实践与分享。</p></section>}</main></body></html>
